    {
      "id": "p0132-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because this \"Snowdin\" name carries extra meanings that would be lost in Japanese, the localization team renamed the town \"Snowful\". This new name seems like an arbitrary change at first, but it offered its own unique wordplay:",
        "raw": "Because this \"Snowdin\" name carries extra meanings that would be lost in\nJapanese, the localization team renamed the town \"Snowful\". This new name\nseems like an arbitrary change at first, but it offered its own unique wordplay:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29293121,
          0.38652143,
          0.89180052,
          0.43503571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29083497,
          0.38580714,
          0.91423537,
          0.43610714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          16,
          17,
          18
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "“Snowdin”这些额外含义在日语中会丢失，因此本地化团队把小镇改名为“Snowful”。乍看像是随意改名，却有自己独特的文字游戏：",
