    {
      "id": "p0132-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This small localization change required more work than one might expect, however, as the town's welcome sign exists as part of the game's map data rather than the game's text data. The progTammer had to account for this to ensure that the proper sign is loaded based on the user's language preference.",
